### Upload course (MBZ file)
POST {{host}}/webservice/rest/server.php
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="wstoken"

{{moodleToken}}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="wsfunction"

local_adler_upload_course
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="moodlewsrestformat"

json

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mbz"; filename="course.mbz"
Content-Type: application/zip

< C:\Users\Markus\tmp_sample_course\23120608_SoftwareEngineering\23120608_SoftwareEngineering.mbz
--WebAppBoundary--
